    "detailed_description": "Earth is ruined by humans. The wealthy built a grand city, Highland, leaving the poor in Lowland to suffer exploitation.<br><br>You play Tamora, a young and vulnerable girl from the prosperous Highland. After losing her father in an accident, Tamora finds herself in a dangerous world. Once-familiar animals are now predatory; trees in forests have turned into sinister hunters, and even beloved pets like dogs and cats are now cruel foes. Tamora must dodge monsters and robots to reach home. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540080/extras/d8205dc7a8b4ac6865c26beae0a80045.poster.avif?t=1720556727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540080/extras/d8205dc7a8b4ac6865c26beae0a80045.webm?t=1720556727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540080/extras/d8205dc7a8b4ac6865c26beae0a80045.mp4?t=1720556727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>On her way home her quest will be reuniting with her father and finding her way back home. She'll experience the harsh life of the Lowlanders. You\u2019ll grapple with notions of justice and equality while struggling to survive in the lowlands, teetering on the edge of extinction. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540080/extras/182010a3efc03a23277384c07efd02bd.poster.avif?t=1720556727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540080/extras/182010a3efc03a23277384c07efd02bd.webm?t=1720556727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540080/extras/182010a3efc03a23277384c07efd02bd.mp4?t=1720556727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
